  "notes": "Electron-style desktop music player (SPlayer Next) with window controls in the top bar. Neutral grey/white palette where colour comes entirely from generated geometric cover art (circles, stripes, tilted squares over saturated gradients) and artist avatars rendered as gradient circles with a single initial glyph. Only accent is a very dark brown (#2c1513) primary pill button '立即播放'; secondary actions are grey pills. Active nav item gets a grey filled pill with a dark left bar. Section headers pair bold title with small muted subtitle. Bottom player bar has a thin dark progress line along its top edge. Rows of outlined white cards (12px radius) for quick modes and most-played songs contrast with borderless cover grids."
